# Your real personal data — never committed, so a public fork/push can't
# leak it. content.example/ and media.example/ are the tracked, editable
# templates; `npm install` (or `npm run init-content`) seeds these from
# them the first time, and never overwrites files you've already edited.
/content/
/media/
resume.pdf

